{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 5, :comments ["<b>And He brought him outside</b> — in gematria: איצטגנינותך (your astrology). כה יהיה זרעך — meaning: when he has another 25 years, equal to the numerical value of כה, he will have seed, for at the Covenant Between the Pieces Abraham was 75 years old." "<b>יהיה</b> — in gematria 30, to tell you that there is no generation without 30 righteous. And likewise, equal to the numerical value of יהיה, righteous will be in your seed, as stated: And He said to him, כה יהיה זרעך."], :book :genesis, :voice :baal-haturim, :lang :en, :chapter 15, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Kitzur Baal HaTurim" "http://sefaria.org"] ["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-12T19:16:09.391199299Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}